    CORE->>SH: Insert donation status = pending
    SH-->>CORE: Donation created
    CORE->>SYNC: Tao job dong bo ve trung tam
    SYNC->>CDB: Ghi tong hop / audit / bao cao trung tam
    CDB-->>SYNC: Success
    CORE-->>API: Created
    API-->>FE: 201 Created
